Syntactic check for VarIfAtom lhs

Add CompileError::IfVarLhsNotVarOrWildcard, emitted by
check_syntactic when the left-hand side of an if-side `term : Type`
atom isn't a Term::Var or Term::Wildcard. Mirrors the existing
ThenDefinedNotVar check for the then-side `var := term` form.

algebraize::walk_term's IfAtom::Var branch relies on the new
invariant: the Term::Var case inserts into var_els, Term::Wildcard
is a no-op, and the remaining term shapes unreachable!() with a
reference to the syntactic check.

Adds a compile test case `if-var-lhs-not-var` exercising the new
error path.
